{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565070/extras/74548cd34d5a8df4eb4f062deb0c5b89.avif?t=1761043728\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565070/extras_big/74548cd34d5a8df4eb4f062deb0c5b89.avif?t=1761043728 width=800 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565070/extras/78cfe20f7eafb29d99c53bbdf037d431.avif?t=1761043728\" width=1373 height=844 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cybernoir</strong> is a <i>cyberpunk</i> <strong>open-world action sandbox game</strong>. Step into the shoes of a nameless <strong>detective</strong>, navigating a dark <strong>neo-noir</strong> city of the future. Take on a wide variety of missions: eliminate high-value targets, solve brutal <strong>crime cases</strong>, hunt down criminals, and battle ruthless gangs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sprawling open world filled with intrigue, corruption, and criminal underworlds awaits. Every alley hides new dangers and opportunities. Make morally challenging choices that shape the story and your relationships with powerful factions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the city on foot or by vehicle, upgrade your gear and abilities, and uncover hidden locations. Engage in dynamic <strong>third-person action</strong> or strike from the shadows. <strong>Cybernoir</strong> offers a unique blend of intense combat, nonlinear storytelling, and immersive <strong>detective gameplay</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for fans of <strong>detective games</strong>, <strong>story-driven action games</strong>, <strong>cyberpunk worlds</strong>, and <strong>open-world sandbox experiences</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"